        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d14c2982-7715-3a6a-8f9f-cee0d7ccfd9d",
                "word": "первоначально",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e47e8ac-2144-3a92-819a-eb6acd7e6fba",
                        "entry_id": "d14c2982-7715-3a6a-8f9f-cee0d7ccfd9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к первоначальный; предшествуя всему прочему; прежде, ранее всего"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ceadd4aa-b704-426b-9f38-7ffaaa0752db",
                                "sense_id": "8e47e8ac-2144-3a92-819a-eb6acd7e6fba",
                                "text": "Симон изъяснил, как Бог первоначально призрел на язычников, чтобы составить из них народ во имя Свое."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9c2de08-ae17-4fb5-b6e1-fe18c496b356",
                                "sense_id": "8e47e8ac-2144-3a92-819a-eb6acd7e6fba",
                                "text": "Но опишу первоначально залу и устройство театра."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91f2326a-cab7-454a-8e91-616029336a2b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d14c2982-7715-3a6a-8f9f-cee0d7ccfd9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "8e47e8ac-2144-3a92-819a-eb6acd7e6fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "initially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "initially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                        "entry_id": "d39182c3-17f1-3c6f-83cd-f03009e215e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At the beginning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42df5fd7-c6d0-49c8-a220-d3965c419227",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Initially, I found city life incredibly difficult, but now I'm used to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7127e53f-58fc-4cb9-84f0-d7b84143fe23",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "In his submission to the UN, [Christof] Heyns points to the experience of drones. Unmanned aerial vehicles were intended initially only for surveillance, and their use for offensive purposes was prohibited, yet once strategists realised their perceived advantages as a means of carrying out targeted killings, all objections were swept out of the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c53cf10c-7266-41d6-8cfb-b542aa1f0f78",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Unsurprisingly, the Group was highly critical of the BTC's organisation and finances, and this prompted Marples to bring forward the Transport Act 1962, which created BR as a standalone entity with its own Board, headed by a full-time chairman. Beeching accepted this latter position, and initially became the BTC chairman in June 1961."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cecaea1f-6964-4c7f-b565-c6e99e4d2edc",
                        "source_entry_id": "d14c2982-7715-3a6a-8f9f-cee0d7ccfd9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "8e47e8ac-2144-3a92-819a-eb6acd7e6fba",
                        "target_lang_word": "originally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "originally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d963c0f-d257-3170-a48d-91af7103fa05",
                                        "entry_id": "9157079e-624d-3ee9-b135-0d6d2deeb4ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As it was in the beginning; at first."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3d66e37-82ce-4e15-869e-f6f7d6cd2e25",
                                                "sense_id": "9d963c0f-d257-3170-a48d-91af7103fa05",
                                                "text": "Originally, this paper was white, but over the years it has yellowed with age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af10b5cb-60e7-4daf-8e5b-63bc093f8653",
                                                "sense_id": "9d963c0f-d257-3170-a48d-91af7103fa05",
                                                "text": "There are 36 known praenomina, though there may originally have been more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a43b0e92-06ba-4da6-9f72-96a918009c9c",
                                                "sense_id": "9d963c0f-d257-3170-a48d-91af7103fa05",
                                                "text": "The little green men were clearly professional soldiers by their bearing, carried Russian weapons, and wore Russian combat fatigues, but they had no identifying insignia. Vladimir Putin originally denied they were Russian soldiers; that April, he confirmed they were."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae720122-c444-30ab-985d-c8379b5d9818",
                                        "entry_id": "9157079e-624d-3ee9-b135-0d6d2deeb4ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an original manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b2f3562-9390-4bae-80bf-d57d71676d16",
                                                "sense_id": "ae720122-c444-30ab-985d-c8379b5d9818",
                                                "text": "They had to think originally to come up with those creative ideas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
